    "name": "Swarm Survivor: Endless Siege",
    "steam_appid": 3745020,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Hyper-Lightweight, Ultra-Satisfying Space-Themed Bullet Hell Game!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the last hope of the Swarm. The survival challenge against an endless fleet has begun!<br>No movement required, no need to collect XP \u2014 just focus on building your skills and indulge in the pure, violent pleasure of mowing down everything in your path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddec <strong>[Core Gameplay Highlights]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Minimal Controls, Maximum Satisfaction</strong><br>No movement, no pickups \u2014 fully automatic combat! All you need to do is focus on each upgrade choice and create your ultimate build!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745020/extras/7c9ed879933964f3c4238fbd71a28a4c.poster.avif?t=1755684249\" width=550 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745020/extras/7c9ed879933964f3c4238fbd71a28a4c.webm?t=1755684249\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745020/extras/7c9ed879933964f3c4238fbd71a28a4c.mp4?t=1755684249\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Fast Builds, Instant Carnage</strong><br>Streamlined roguelite progression means you\u2019ll finish your build in just minutes and enter \u201cUnstoppable Mode,\u201d unleashing waves of bullets and skills in every direction!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745020/extras/3b58a7d788181b67288b897190b4258a.poster.avif?t=1755684249\" width=800 height=436 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745020/extras/3b58a7d788181b67288b897190b4258a.webm?t=1755684249\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745020/extras/3b58a7d788181b67288b897190b4258a.mp4?t=1755684249\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Deep Customization, Endless Strategy</strong><br>Defeat bosses and level up to choose from a wide variety of powerful upgrades and breakthroughs. Every run is a unique build \u2014 every game, a new kind of thrill!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Endless Mode, True Survival</strong><br>After Wave 30, enter an auto-battle Endless Mode. How long can you survive the escalating swarm of enemies?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745020/extras/66c7ee3376f9a376d5588a5bd0b6976d.poster.avif?t=1755684249\" width=500 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745020/extras/66c7ee3376f9a376d5588a5bd0b6976d.webm?t=1755684249\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745020/extras/66c7ee3376f9a376d5588a5bd0b6976d.mp4?t=1755684249\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Talent System, Permanent Power Growth</strong><br>Progress never resets \u2014 unlock permanent upgrades and core talents to push even further each run!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745020/extras/f06b15d5a70dc87fae18643d24b878a8.poster.avif?t=1755684249\" width=800 height=436 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745020/extras/f06b15d5a70dc87fae18643d24b878a8.webm?t=1755684249\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745020/extras/f06b15d5a70dc87fae18643d24b878a8.mp4?t=1755684249\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Mystery Events, Surprising Twists</strong><br>Random events trigger mid-battle \u2014 will it be a bonus or a curse? Anything can happen!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Global Leaderboard, Claim Your Glory</strong><br>Compete for the top ranks against players from around the world and prove yourself the ultimate Swarm survivor!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ready, Swarm warrior? The fleet is here!</strong><br>Jump into a fast-paced, all-out survival challenge and see how many waves you can endure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745020/extras/58ebec1ef98f487ec18b4482c72befdd.poster.avif?t=1755684249\" aria-label=\"[gif1\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745020/extras/58ebec1ef98f487ec18b4482c72befdd.webm?t=1755684249\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745020/extras/58ebec1ef98f487ec18b4482c72befdd.mp4?t=1755684249\" type=\"video/mp4\">\" width=\"500\" height=\"274\"]</video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Hyper-Lightweight, Ultra-Satisfying Space-Themed Bullet Hell Game!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the last hope of the Swarm. The survival challenge against an endless fleet has begun!<br>No movement required, no need to collect XP \u2014 just focus on building your skills and indulge in the pure, violent pleasure of mowing down everything in your path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddec <strong>[Core Gameplay Highlights]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Minimal Controls, Maximum Satisfaction</strong><br>No movement, no pickups \u2014 fully automatic combat! All you need to do is focus on each upgrade choice and create your ultimate build!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745020/extras/7c9ed879933964f3c4238fbd71a28a4c.poster.avif?t=1755684249\" width=550 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745020/extras/7c9ed879933964f3c4238fbd71a28a4c.webm?t=1755684249\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745020/extras/7c9ed879933964f3c4238fbd71a28a4c.mp4?t=1755684249\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Fast Builds, Instant Carnage</strong><br>Streamlined roguelite progression means you\u2019ll finish your build in just minutes and enter \u201cUnstoppable Mode,\u201d unleashing waves of bullets and skills in every direction!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745020/extras/3b58a7d788181b67288b897190b4258a.poster.avif?t=1755684249\" width=800 height=436 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745020/extras/3b58a7d788181b67288b897190b4258a.webm?t=1755684249\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745020/extras/3b58a7d788181b67288b897190b4258a.mp4?t=1755684249\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Deep Customization, Endless Strategy</strong><br>Defeat bosses and level up to choose from a wide variety of powerful upgrades and breakthroughs. Every run is a unique build \u2014 every game, a new kind of thrill!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Endless Mode, True Survival</strong><br>After Wave 30, enter an auto-battle Endless Mode. How long can you survive the escalating swarm of enemies?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745020/extras/66c7ee3376f9a376d5588a5bd0b6976d.poster.avif?t=1755684249\" width=500 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745020/extras/66c7ee3376f9a376d5588a5bd0b6976d.webm?t=1755684249\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745020/extras/66c7ee3376f9a376d5588a5bd0b6976d.mp4?t=1755684249\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Talent System, Permanent Power Growth</strong><br>Progress never resets \u2014 unlock permanent upgrades and core talents to push even further each run!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745020/extras/f06b15d5a70dc87fae18643d24b878a8.poster.avif?t=1755684249\" width=800 height=436 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745020/extras/f06b15d5a70dc87fae18643d24b878a8.webm?t=1755684249\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745020/extras/f06b15d5a70dc87fae18643d24b878a8.mp4?t=1755684249\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Mystery Events, Surprising Twists</strong><br>Random events trigger mid-battle \u2014 will it be a bonus or a curse? Anything can happen!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Global Leaderboard, Claim Your Glory</strong><br>Compete for the top ranks against players from around the world and prove yourself the ultimate Swarm survivor!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ready, Swarm warrior? The fleet is here!</strong><br>Jump into a fast-paced, all-out survival challenge and see how many waves you can endure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745020/extras/58ebec1ef98f487ec18b4482c72befdd.poster.avif?t=1755684249\" aria-label=\"[gif1\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745020/extras/58ebec1ef98f487ec18b4482c72befdd.webm?t=1755684249\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745020/extras/58ebec1ef98f487ec18b4482c72befdd.mp4?t=1755684249\" type=\"video/mp4\">\" width=\"500\" height=\"274\"]</video></span></p>",
